title: "Execution-Gated Refinement for Text-to-SQL with Frozen Language Models: code, frozen configurations, analysis plan and replay archive"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen configurations, pre-specified statistical analysis plan with dated amendments, lock file, result files and replay
  scripts for a seven-module text-to-SQL pipeline around frozen, API-hosted language models, evaluated on the BIRD benchmark.
